A||||7||Dan86gt3.8||I was 1 and 2 on 5.0's tonight||||12||
Z||000000||Dan86gt3.8||04-01-2000||04:07 AM||||Yup thats right went out to the new cruising spot I found in my college town (San Marcos, TX) if ya didn't know.  Anyways I raced a 89 5.0 auto/convertable and raced right at a 1/4 and I had about 3 links on him when I was at 100-110.  Then I raced a 92 lx, 5.0 5spd, he had full exhaust/pulleys/3.73's.  anyways we lined up and he jumped me a little on the start but he got about 3 cars right at the 1/4 mark, so he beat me about the same margin I beat the auto, he runs 14.1's and the auto runs 15.2-6's.  So once again it brings me to my theory I am gona run a high 14 or low 15.  I hope high 14 or so.  Anyways it was a good time!  There was  supposed to be a bunch of ricers out, but none of them showed.  there was an eclipse running around with a spoiler, I think came of an f-16 fighter plane.  Looked alot like what tom cruise drove in top gun.  You know thoose front wheel drive eclipses, need downforce on thoose rear wheels, sinse they go so fast and need downforce on thoose rear wheels that do all the driving.  I want to get a hold of a GS-t I have raced a GSX before and did really good (i beat him to 35 from 35 to 90 we were dead even, then his turbo's kicked in and started laying cars down at 90+).  anyways I want to get a hold of a plain gst thats stock.  and there are a million of them in this town, I think if you took a survey here at SWT 1 out of 3 people drive an eclipse, and out of all thoose I have seen at least 15 different GST's.  matter of fact there is a gs, eclipse that lives at my dorm and he's got the deadly 3 combo (fart can, painted calipers, and fog lights).  Ohhh by the way the ferrari they blow up in Korns "got the life" video, was a kit car.  They didn't say if it was a fiero kit, but they said it still cost 25K!  thats enough rambling for me I need tog get to bed!||||reg||12
Z||000001||superXmotorsports||04-01-2000||12:43 PM||||My stock 97 GST Spyder ran a 14.9.  With a HKS 3" exhaust and HKS super mega flow intake and blow off valve it ran a 14.3.  Owning both a Mitsu and Fieros watch out for a properly modified Eclipse they can really kick ass.  A GSX is easily capable of low 13's.  But you should be able to whip every poser one you see!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  SXM.||||reg||1
